OL,3,GNEWSASuspended Reform councillor found
OL,4,Aguilty over post
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: Some readers may find language
OL,7,Fin this story offensive
OL,9,FA suspended Reform UK councillor has
OL,10,Fbeen convicted of a malicious
OL,11,Fcommunication over a Facebook post
OL,12,Fabout Nigerian people.
OL,14,FSunderland city councillor Glenn
OL,15,FGibbins has been sentenced to a
OL,16,F12-month community order with 150 hours
OL,17,Fof unpaid work for the "grossly
OL,18,Foffensive" post made in March 2024.
OL,20,FIt came to light after he was elected
OL,21,Fto represent the Hylton Castle ward in
OL,22,FMay 2026.
